---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout pageName="Persona">
  <div class="wrap">
    <section>
      <h2 class="center">Behind all of this!</h2>
      <p>
        Well, hi! I'm not sure why you're here, and even less sure why you'd
        want to read about me, but... if you do, who am I to stop you?
      </p>
      <p>
        So, hi again! I'm Pavel, and this is my space that I created as part of
        my portfolio and as a personal area to store my projects and ideas, and
        to share them with my friends in a way that's more than just sending
        links.
      </p>
      <p>
        As a person who loves to create, I've always been drawn to finding the
        perfect medium for me. I've tried everything, but none of them gave me
        the creative freedom I needed, as none of them fully reflected my
        vision. So, I try to combine different mediums, and programming has
        allowed me to truly create what I want!
      </p>
      <p>
        I love storytelling, whether through images, sounds, or plain narrative,
        and programming lets me bring it all together into one great interactive
        adventure. Given all this, it's no surprise that my goal became game
        development and creating my own worlds. However, I don't limit myself to
        just that. I find joy and excitement in making "something out of
        nothing," whether it's a game, a program, or a website.
      </p>
      <p>
        Through my learning journey, I discovered that my true passion and
        relaxation come not necessarily from creating games, but from developing
        game engines. I love the idea of creating tools that can express
        visions. Additionally, as someone who appreciates knowledge and science,
        I enjoy the ability to replicate real-world phenomena in the digital
        realm. If you'd like to stick around and check out my projects, go ahead
        and WELCOME! :)
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="whatNow">
      <h3 class="center">So what now?</h3>
      <p>
        Now, I just want to do what I love. I code both as my job and as my
        hobby, and I'm deeply immersed in this world with the hope of one day
        telling my own stories through my games and projects. Feel free to reach
        out and ask me anything you’d like to know more about. You can find my
        social media links on the main page.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style lang="scss">
  @import "../styles/vars.scss";
  p {
    padding-block: 0.5rem;
  }
  .wrap {
    padding: 4rem 20%;
    @media (max-width: $midScreen) {
      padding: 3rem 10%;
    }
    @media (max-width: $smallScreen) {
      padding: 2rem 2rem;
    }
  }

  p {
    color: $primaryColor;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    @media (max-width: $midScreen) {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
  section {
  }

  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }
  h3,
  h2 {
    font-weight: bold;
    color: $secondaryColor;
    font-size: 3rem;
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    @media (max-width: $midScreen) {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: $smallScreen) {
      font-size: 2rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
